---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'September 5, 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Accessibility · Viva Wellness Co."
  description="Viva Wellness Co.'s commitment to accessibility, the standards we target (WCAG 2.2 AA), and how to report a barrier."
>

  <section class="legal-hero">
    <div class="container legal-hero__inner">
      <span class="eyebrow">Accessibility</span>
      <h1 class="legal-hero__title">
        Built to be <span class="italic-display">used by everyone.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Healthcare information should not have barriers. Here is what we
        target, what we have done, and how to tell us when we have missed
        something.
      </p>
      <p class="legal-hero__updated">Last updated · {lastUpdated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-body">
    <div class="container legal-body__inner">

      <div class="legal-callout">
        <strong>Our standard.</strong>
        Viva targets Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2 Level AA
        for this public website. Third-party services, including booking and
        the patient portal, are operated by their respective vendors and may
        have separate accessibility statements and support channels.
      </div>

      <h2 class="legal-h">What this means in practice</h2>
      <ul class="legal-list">
        <li>A “Skip to main content” link and visible keyboard focus styles are provided sitewide</li>
        <li>Navigation, buttons, disclosure widgets, and forms are designed for keyboard use</li>
        <li>Text and interactive controls are tested against WCAG contrast requirements</li>
        <li>Form controls use visible labels, instructions, and announced error or status messages</li>
        <li>The mobile menu manages focus while open and returns focus when closed</li>
        <li>Nonessential motion is reduced when the operating system reports <code>prefers-reduced-motion</code></li>
        <li>Meaningful images have text alternatives; decorative graphics are hidden from assistive technology</li>
        <li>Layouts are tested at small screens and browser zoom to reduce horizontal scrolling and content loss</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="legal-h">Working with our team</h2>
      <p>
        If you cannot access information or complete a task on this website
        or in our patient portal, contact us and we will provide the
        information or perform the task in a different format. We do not
        require you to use the website to become a patient.
      </p>
      <ul class="legal-list">
        <li>Email <a href="mailto:info&#64;vivawellnessco.com">info&#64;vivawellnessco.com</a></li>
        <li>Call or text <a href="tel:+17372107283">(737) 210-7283</a></li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="legal-h">Report a barrier</h2>
      <p>
        Found something that does not work for you? Tell us. Send the page
        URL, what you were trying to do, what got in the way, and the
        assistive technology you use (if any). We will acknowledge the report
        and work to provide the requested information or a reasonable alternative
        as promptly as practical.
      </p>
      <p>
        Email <a href="mailto:info&#64;vivawellnessco.com">info&#64;vivawellnessco.com</a>
        with "Accessibility" in the subject line.
      </p>

      <h2 class="legal-h">Ongoing work</h2>
      <p>
        Accessibility is not a one-time project. We use automated checks,
        keyboard testing, responsive review, and targeted manual inspection as
        part of significant site changes. Automated testing cannot find every
        barrier, so reports from people using the site remain important.
      </p>

      <h2 class="legal-h">Formal complaints</h2>
      <p>
        If you believe the practice has not provided equal access to its
        services based on disability, you may file a complaint with the
        U.S. Department of Health and Human Services, Office for Civil
        Rights, under Section 1557 of the Affordable Care Act:
        <a href="https://www.hhs.gov/ocr/complaints/index.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">hhs.gov/ocr/complaints</a>.
        You will not be retaliated against for filing a complaint.
      </p>

      <p class="legal-foot">
        Viva Wellness Co. · 5900 Balcones Dr #19640, Austin, TX 78731
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-hero {
    padding: var(--section-pad) 0 3rem;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .legal-hero__inner { position: relative; max-width: 70ch; }
  .legal-hero__title {
    font-size: var(--text-h1);
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem;
  }
  .legal-hero__updated {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    text-transform: none;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-top: 1.4rem;
    padding-top: 1.2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .legal-body { padding: 2rem 0 var(--section-pad); }
  .legal-body__inner { max-width: 70ch; margin: 0 auto; }

  .legal-callout {
    background: var(--surface-card);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--text-primary);
    padding: 1.6rem 1.8rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  .legal-callout strong {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    text-transform: none;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .legal-h {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.6vw, 1.9rem);
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  .legal-body p {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
    max-width: none;
  }
  .legal-body a {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-control);
    transition: color 200ms var(--ease), border-color 200ms var(--ease);
  }
  .legal-body a:hover {
    color: var(--surface-inverse-hover);
    border-color: var(--surface-inverse-hover);
  }
  .legal-body code {
    font-family: var(--font-code);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    background: var(--surface-card);
    padding: 0.1rem 0.35rem;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }
  .legal-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    margin: 0.5rem 0 1.5rem;
  }
  .legal-list li {
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
    position: relative;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .legal-list li::before {
    content: '·';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .legal-foot {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .legal-hero { padding: 3rem 0 2rem; }
    .legal-hero__title { font-size: var(--text-h1); margin: 0.75rem 0 1.15rem; }
    .legal-body { padding: 1.75rem 0 4rem; }
    .legal-callout { padding: 1.25rem; }
  }
</style>
